Core Authentication Component Mapping:

  Primary Login Components:

  - Form + Card + Input + Label + Button - LoginForm
  structure
  - Dialog + Dialog.Trigger + Dialog.Content - LoginModal
  overlay
  - Alert - Error messages and validation feedback
  - Separator + Checkbox - Remember me and social login
  dividers

  Registration & Verification:

  - Form + Card + Progress - Multi-step registration
  - Input + Textarea + Button - Registration fields and
  actions
  - Alert + Badge + Skeleton - Email verification states

  Password Management:

  - Form + Card + Input - Password reset and change forms
  - Progress - Password strength indicators
  - Button + Alert - Reset actions and confirmations

  Account Dashboard:

  - Tabs + Card + Switch + Select - Account settings
  structure
  - Avatar + Table + Pagination - Profile and order history
  - Badge - Status indicators throughout

  Mobile Authentication:

  - Sheet + Sheet.Trigger + Sheet.Content - Mobile auth
  drawer
  - Navigation-Menu + Dropdown-Menu - Mobile authenticated
  navigation
  - Drawer - Alternative mobile auth pattern

  Security Features:

  - Form + Input + Badge - Two-factor authentication
  - Table + Button - Session management
  - Switch + Alert - Security settings and notifications

  Loading & Error States:

  - Skeleton + Progress + Spinner - Loading indicators
  - Alert - Error handling with variants
  - Toast/Sonner - Session and security notifications

  The authentication system is now fully mapped with
  shadcn/ui components, providing a complete foundation for
  secure user authentication with the Honduras Coffee
  claymorphism theme, Supabase integration, and
  mobile-optimized experience.